Third-party material bundled in this crate
==========================================

src/validate/source/epub/xml/schema/30/
    EPUB 3 RELAX NG grammars and Schematron rules from the International
    Digital Publishing Forum, under the permission notice in that directory's
    LICENSE file. Subdirectories covering HTML5, MathML and the security module
    carry their own LICENSE files, which override it.

src/validate/source/epub/xml/schema/20/
    EPUB 2 DTDs and Schematron rules: XHTML 1.0 and SVG 1.1 from the W3C, NCX
    and DTBook from the DAISY Consortium, OPF and OEB from the Open eBook Forum
    and its successor the IDPF. Each file states its own copyright and
    permission notice in its header.
